  "title": "Modernizing Global Vulnerability Standards For The Age Of AI",
  "summary": "As AI-driven vulnerability discovery accelerates, the cybersecurity ecosystem is being forced to examine whether the standards, disclosure processes, and prioritization frameworks defenders rely on can still keep pace. In Rapid7’s new policy paper, understand where today’s vulnerability management infrastructure is breaking under AI-era conditions, and what governments, security companies, and frontier AI providers need to do next.",
